    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree DFS (bottom-up)</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP on trees</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-tree-maximum-path-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 124</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Binary Tree Maximum Path Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every path has one highest node where it bends. A post-order DFS returns to the parent the best one-sided arm (node + max(left, right, clamped at 0)) and, at the same node, records the bend node + left + right as a candidate answer. O(n) time, O(h) stack.</p>\n"
  },
